        "original_id": "c931c33c-8d85-5272-9108-0c3636206747",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lloyd Kaufman, Michael Herz, Jay T. Wright\n- Companies: Troma Entertainment\n- Works: The Toxic Avenger, Tromeo and Juliet, All the Love You Cannes!\n- Roles: film director, producer, screenwriter, actor\n- Topics: narrative tension in films\n\nFacts:\n- Stanley Lloyd Kaufman, Jr. was born on December 30, 1945.\n- Lloyd Kaufman is an American film director, producer, screenwriter, and actor.\n- Lloyd Kaufman and producer Michael Herz co-founded Troma Entertainment.\n- Lloyd Kaufman directed many Troma Entertainment feature films, including \"The Toxic Avenger\" and \"Tromeo and Juliet.\"\n- In many of Jay T. Wright's films, tension acts as a competing motive and sometimes directly conflicts with narrative.\n- \"All the Love You Cannes!\" is a 2002 documentary film directed by Lloyd Kaufman.",
